    "updated_at": "2021-06-28T17:29:29Z",
    "body": "Please try surrounding the multi-word font name in single quotes within the double quotes, like so:\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"terminal.integrated.fontFamily\": \"'FiraCode Nerd Font'\"\r\n}\r\n```",
